   ? panel text near the ratings: ho joins later (a signing, a pick, a trade) slots in by his rating, so a better newcomer starts right away, and Sort by rating hands a group back to the sim. The Roster box opens on one tile per position group plus one for the practice squad, so fifty men never turn into one long list. The men at the top of each group's depth chart start, the bench steps in when a starter gets hurt, and the practice squad sits off the cap until you call a man up. A call-up needs a roster spot
